      "statement": "create_deep_agent() is the assembly point that resolves the model and harness profile, resolves the backend, assembles the main-agent middleware stack, builds the default general-purpose subagent, composes the final system prompt, and delegates to LangChain's create_agent(...) to produce the runnable graph.",
