      "statement": "Talon's DeepAgentRuntime resolves subagents and constructs its SDK graph at start; each invoke establishes request-scoped authorization, history, cron, graph, and background-result context, then resets it in a finally block, while stop cancels background work before releasing the graph and checkpointer resources.",
